{"audio": "2john-01.opus", "duration_ms": 96434, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2860, "text": "2 John, Chapter One."}, {"start_ms": 3961, "end_ms": 16022, "text": "The elder, To the chosen lady and her children, whom I love in the truth—and not I alone, but also all who know the truth— because of the truth that abides in us and will be with us forever: Grace, mercy,"}, {"start_ms": 16102, "end_ms": 22143, "text": "and peace from God the Father and from Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, will be with us in truth and love."}, {"start_ms": 23443, "end_ms": 28664, "text": "I was overjoyed to find some of your children walking in the truth, just as the Father has commanded us."}, {"start_ms": 29284, "end_ms": 36345, "text": "And now I urge you, dear lady—not as a new commandment to you, but one we have had from the beginning—that we love one another."}, {"start_ms": 36925, "end_ms": 40026, "text": "And this is love, that we walk according to His commandments."}, {"start_ms": 40646, "end_ms": 44847, "text": "This is the very commandment you have heard from the beginning, that you must walk in love."}, {"start_ms": 45647, "end_ms": 51247, "text": "For many deceivers have gone out into the world, refusing to confess the coming of Jesus Christ in the flesh."}, {"start_ms": 51868, "end_ms": 54788, "text": "Any such person is the deceiver and the antichrist."}, {"start_ms": 55348, "end_ms": 61009, "text": "Watch yourselves, so that you do not lose what we have worked for, but that you may be fully rewarded."}, {"start_ms": 61809, "end_ms": 66170, "text": "Anyone who runs ahead without remaining in the teaching of Christ does not have God."}, {"start_ms": 66770, "end_ms": 70170, "text": "Whoever remains in His teaching has both the Father and the Son."}, {"start_ms": 71070, "end_ms": 76971, "text": "If anyone comes to you but does not bring this teaching, do not receive him into your home or even greet him."}, {"start_ms": 77591, "end_ms": 80652, "text": "Whoever greets such a person shares in his evil deeds."}, {"start_ms": 81772, "end_ms": 86313, "text": "I have many things to write to you, but I would prefer not to do so with paper and ink."}, {"start_ms": 86873, "end_ms": 91713, "text": "Instead, I hope to come and speak with you face to face, so that our joy may be complete."}, {"start_ms": 92353, "end_ms": 95054, "text": "The children of your elect sister send you greetings."}], "words": [{"t": "2", "s": 0, "e": 2140, "si": 0}, {"t": "John,", "s": 2140, "e": 2260, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2300, "e": 2540, "si": 0}, {"t": "One.", "s": 2620, "e": 2860, "si": 0}, {"t": "The", "s": 3961, "e": 4061, "si": 1}, {"t": "elder,", "s": 4161, "e": 4441, "si": 1}, {"t": "To", "s": 4881, "e": 4961, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 5021, "e": 5101, "si": 1}, {"t": "chosen", "s": 5181, "e": 5561, "si": 1}, {"t": "lady", "s": 5641, "e": 5861, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 5981, "e": 6081, "si": 1}, {"t": "her", "s": 6121, "e": 6221, "si": 1}, {"t": "children,", "s": 6281, "e": 6661, "si": 1}, {"t": "whom", "s": 6821, "e": 6981, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 7101, "e": 7121, "si": 1}, {"t": "love", "s": 7201, "e": 7381, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 7421, "e": 7481, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 7501, "e": 7601, "si": 1}, {"t": "truth—and", "s": 7661, "e": 8481, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 8521, "e": 8721, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 8921, "e": 8941, "si": 1}, {"t": "alone,", "s": 8981, "e": 9361, "si": 1}, {"t": "but", "s": 9441, "e": 9561, "si": 1}, {"t": "also", "s": 9621, "e": 9861, "si": 1}, {"t": "all", "s": 10081, "e": 10261, "si": 1}, {"t": "who", "s": 10321, "e": 10442, "si": 1}, {"t": "know", "s": 10482, "e": 10662, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 10702, "e": 10802, "si": 1}, {"t": "truth—", "s": 10842, "e": 11122, "si": 1}, {"t": "because", "s": 11522, "e": 11882, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 11902, "e": 11982, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 12002, "e": 12102, "si": 1}, {"t": "truth", "s": 12142, "e": 12402, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 12422, "e":